{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790256413628,"sessionID":"ses_f2c68a6f7ffeUG3rJLrrdlAQp5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_esVAckDZzAA6vmc3fRllt6SP","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Delete File: /workspace/scripts/inspect_visual_shader.gd\n*** Add File: /workspace/scripts/build_distortion_material.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _init() -> void:\n+\tvar shader := VisualShader.new()\n+\tshader.resource_name = \"DistortionUV\"\n+\tshader.set_mode(Shader.MODE_CANVAS_ITEM)\n+\tshader.set_node_position(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, 0, Vector2(980, 120))\n+\n+\tvar uv := VisualShaderNodeInput.new()\n+\tuv.input_name = \"uv\"\n+\tshader.add_node(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, uv, Vector2(-520, 20), 2)\n+\n+\tvar distortion = load(\"res://addons/shaderV/uv/distortionUV.gd\").new()\n+\tshader.add_node(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, distortion, Vector2(20, 120), 3)\n+\tassert(shader.connect_nodes(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, 2, 0, 3, 0) == OK)\n+\n+\tvar values := [7.0, 5.0, 0.1, 0.1]\n+\tvar names := [\"Wave X\", \"Wave Y\", \"Distortion X\", \"Distortion Y\"]\n+\tfor index in values.size():\n+\t\tvar constant := VisualShaderNodeFloatConstant.new()\n+\t\tconstant.resource_name = names[index]\n+\t\tconstant.constant = values[index]\n+\t\tshader.add_node(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, constant, Vector2(-280, 160 + index * 140), 4 + index)\n+\t\tassert(shader.connect_nodes(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, 4 + index, 0, 3, index + 1) == OK)\n+\n+\tvar texture := VisualShaderNodeTexture.new()\n+\ttexture.source = VisualShaderNodeTexture.SOURCE_2D_TEXTURE\n+\tshader.add_node(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, texture, Vector2(460, 120), 8)\n+\tassert(shader.connect_nodes(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, 3, 0, 8, 0) == OK)\n+\tassert(shader.connect_nodes(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, 8, 0, 0, 0) == OK)\n+\tassert(shader.connect_nodes(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT, 8, 1, 0, 1) == OK)\n+\n+\tvar material := ShaderMaterial.new()\n+\tmaterial.resource_name = \"Distortion Preview\"\n+\tmaterial.shader = shader\n+\tvar error := ResourceSaver.save(material, \"res://scenes/distortion_preview.tres\")\n+\tprint(\"Material saved: \", error_string(error))\n+\tprint(shader.code)\n+\tquit(error)\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/main.tscn\n@@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://b0x4fw2btt1kp\"]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid=\"uid://b0x4fw2btt1kp\"]\n \n [ext_resource type=\"Texture2D\" uid=\"uid://c3cqh4a2vmb4j\" path=\"res://addons/shaderV/shaderV_icon.png\" id=\"1\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Material\" path=\"res://scenes/distortion_preview.tres\" id=\"2\"]\n \n [node name=\"Main\" type=\"Control\"]\n+layout_mode = 3\n+anchors_preset = 15\n+anchor_right = 1.0\n+anchor_bottom = 1.0\n+grow_horizontal = 2\n+grow_vertical = 2\n \n [node name=\"DistortionPreview\" type=\"TextureRect\" parent=\".\"]\n+material = ExtResource(\"2\")\n+layout_mode = 0\n+anchors_preset = 8\n+anchor_left = 0.5\n+anchor_top = 0.5\n+anchor_right = 0.5\n+anchor_bottom = 0.5\n+offset_left = -192.0\n+offset_top = -192.0\n+offset_right = 192.0\n+offset_bottom = 192.0\n+grow_horizontal = 2\n+grow_vertical = 2\n texture = ExtResource(\"1\")\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nD workspace/scripts/inspect_visual_shader.gd\nA workspace/scripts/build_distortion_material.gd\nM workspace/scenes/main.tscn","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scripts/inspect_visual_shader.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/inspect_visual_shader.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/inspect_visual_shader.gd\n@@ -1,18 +0,0 @@\n-extends SceneTree\n-\n-func _init() -> void:\n-\tvar visual_shader := VisualShader.new()\n-\tvar texture_node := VisualShaderNodeTexture.new()\n-\tvar output := visual_shader.get_node_list(VisualShader.TYPE_FRAGMENT)\n-\tprint(\"fragment nodes: \", output)\n-\tprint(\"texture props:\")\n-\tfor property in texture_node.get_property_list():\n-\t\tif property.name i